# The table editor, sounds and rules (tests/t1/pinball3d_editor.sh), window 1440x900. Things are taken by their names and paths
# (Cmd+G), fields by their keys (Cmd+F): no line of a form is aimed at by its place.
# A sound: "+sound" adds one (a generated tone until it names a file); its pitch is typed.
4 key g meta
5 text +sound
6 key Enter
8 key f meta
9 text hz
10 key Tab
11 text 880
12 key Enter
# The first bumper plays it when it is hit: the event is found by its path in the form, the sound is chosen in the list of the
# table's sounds (its second line, after "none"), and the button beside it lets it be heard.
14 key g meta
15 text pop1
16 key Enter
18 key f meta
19 text sounds.hit
21 move 1300 112
22 down
23 up
26 move 1300 168
27 down
28 up
30 move 1383 112
31 down
32 up
# The music of a ball in play is the same sound.
34 key g meta
35 text music
36 key Enter
38 key f meta
39 text play
41 move 1300 112
42 down
43 up
45 move 1300 168
46 down
47 up
# A rule: "+rule" adds one to the rules and opens it; it is written as the file has it (Cmd+J), and a click beside the board
# leaves the field. Then its action is opened by its path and its value typed in its form.
50 key g meta
51 text +rule
52 key Enter
54 key j meta
56 key a meta
57 text {"on":"pop1","event":"hit","do":[{"do":"score","value":250}]}
59 move 420 500
60 down
61 up
63 key g meta
64 text rules.when[24].do[0]
65 key Enter
67 key f meta
68 text value
69 key Tab
70 text 300
71 key Enter
# A mission: "+mission" adds one with a step; its name is typed; its step listens to the group of the bumpers (chosen in the
# long list of what the table has by typing its name) being hit (the event, chosen the same way), three times.
73 key g meta
74 text +mission
75 key Enter
77 key f meta
78 text name
79 key Tab
80 text Bumpers
81 key Enter
83 key g meta
84 text rules.missions[6].steps[0]
85 key Enter
87 key f meta
88 text on
90 move 1300 112
91 down
92 up
94 text pops
95 key Enter
97 key f meta
98 text event
100 move 1300 112
101 down
102 up
104 text hit
105 key Enter
107 key f meta
108 text count
109 key Tab
110 text 3
111 key Enter
# The rules of the game itself: the ball save, the warnings before a tilt, the balls of multiball.
113 key g meta
114 text rules
115 key Enter
117 key f meta
118 text ballSave
119 key Tab
120 text 12
121 key Enter
123 key f meta
124 text tilt.warnings
125 key Tab
126 text 3
127 key Enter
129 key f meta
130 text multiball.balls
